# Cursor Workflow Rules

- Before coding, inspect relevant files.
- Do not rewrite unrelated files.
- Do not create large implementations in one step.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes.
- If the task is architectural, produce a plan first.
- If requirements are unclear, ask before implementing.
- After changes, summarize what changed and why.
- Mention any assumptions explicitly.